    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by Section 52 of the Sri Lanka Electricity Act, No. 20 of 2009 and upon the recommen-dations made by the Minister in charge of the subject of Power and Energy, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka being of the opinion that :-",
