      413.05,
      539.94,
      457.24
    ],
    "text": "(a)the land specified in the Schedule hereto is urgently required for the construction of a Power TransmissionProject ; and(b)the said Power Transmission Project being a public purpose would serve for the general welfare and benefit ofthe public.",
    "fonts": [
